description:
Structured output (strict response_format). After schema validation the code checks:
- every [Cxxx]/[Fxx] in memo_markdown exists in the input;
- cited_ids equals the set cited in the text;
- every number in memo_markdown is immediately attributable to a cited claim or fact with the identical value;
- every recommendation's issue_ids and claim_ids exist;
- no banned terms appear (revenue, churn rate, $, lost users).
A failing memo is retried once with the validator's error list. If it fails again, the run stops and reports the problem instead of publishing it.
